# Two players, level 1. The first movie in the project that uses controller 2,
# and the only way to reach the parts of the game that ask *which* player did
# something: the per-player score slots at $80:C7C2 (`score_slot_1`,
# `score_discard`) and a player told about a collision id of its own side
# (`player_ignore`), which needs two players to touch each other.
#
# The boot prefix through frame 1484 is level1.zmv's, unchanged. Controller 2
# joins on the "PLAYER LEFT / PLAYER RIGHT" screen, which is up between roughly
# frames 1090 and 1200 — Start on port 2 anywhere in that window puts Julie in
# the game beside Zeke. Control of both begins around frame 1830.
#
# Retune by watching where it actually gets to:
#   zamn_headless <rom> shot.png 4200 -m movies\level1-2p.zmv --at 1880,2500,3000
